   "launch_compatible_with_frozen_preregistration": false,
   "phase_b_science_changed": false,
   "phase_b_results_changed": false,
   "operational_classification": "post-provider resource ownership, watchdog establishment and verified teardown",
   "what": "post-provider resource ownership in SessionRunner.create(): the pod id, start epoch, actual costPerHr, provider_resource_created and one_use_grant_consumed are assigned, persisted and saved, and the detached watchdog is started, BEFORE the returned price is judged. An over-price resource is then classified as a post-provider consumed abort and torn down through the canonical teardown_now() with provider confirmation, instead of a one-shot unconfirmed 'remove pod' issued before the resource was ever registered.",
   "why_the_owner_is_shared_session_runner": "the defect is in SessionRunner.create(), the only place a returned provider id is parsed, and registration must happen at that parse. Every downstream owner -- the watchdog, teardown_now, run_session's exception handler -- keys on self.pod_id, so no caller can repair it from outside. Phase A, Phase B, the continuations and the preflight share this code and share the defect.",
   "why_a_c1_only_override_was_rejected": "a C1-only create() override would leave every other session with an unowned billing pod on the same path, and would create a second deletion implementation beside teardown_now -- the exact duplication the review forbade.",
   "maintainer_authorization": "MAINTAINER P12 DECISION, 2026-09-07, at origin/main bd4e5880: the stop at the non-additive frozen-set contract was correct; historical accounting and live launch compatibility are hereby SEPARATED; this one narrow shared-runner ownership repair is authorized at $0. Not permission to re-freeze Phase B and not permission to run it.",
   "does_not_authorize": [
    "any Phase-B execution",
    "re-freezing the Phase-B preregistration",
    "reinterpreting the completed Phase-B result",
    "launch compatibility with the frozen preregistration",
    "any relaxation of autoinit_phase_b_launch.preregistration_gate"
   ],
